<PageLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Bachelorette Pole Dancing Parties"
  description="How Bachelorette Pole Dancing Parties collects and uses information: analytics cookies, contact form details, and your choices. We never sell your data."
  canonical="https://www.bachelorettepoledancingparties.com/privacy"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  intro="We keep it simple: we collect as little as possible, we never sell your information, and we only use what you share with us to plan your party."
>
  <section class="container prose reveal">
    <p><em>Last updated: July 31, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Bachelorette Pole Dancing Parties (BPDP) is a small Las Vegas event business. Our parties
      take place at Pole Fitness Studio, 4265 S. Arville Street, Suite A, Las Vegas, Nevada
      89103. You can reach us any time at
      <a href="tel:+17028787653">702-878-POLE (7653)</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>We collect information in two ways:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact form.</strong> If you use the form on our
        <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, we receive the details you type in — your name,
        email address, party date, group size, and message. The form is processed by
        Formspree, a third-party form service, which delivers your message to our inbox. We
        use this information only to answer your questions and plan your party.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Analytics cookies.</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how
        visitors use our site — for example, which pages are popular. Google Analytics sets
        cookies and collects usage data such as pages viewed, approximate location, and device
        type. This data is aggregated and does not tell us who you are personally. You can
        block these cookies in your browser settings or with tools like the
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information. Ever.</li>
      <li>We do not send marketing emails unless you ask us to.</li>
      <li>We do not collect payment details on this website.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Booking and third-party sites</h2>
    <p>
      Party bookings are handled on
      <a href="https://www.polefitnessstudio.com/" rel="noopener">polefitnessstudio.com</a>,
      our studio's website. When you book there, that site's own privacy practices apply. Links
      to other sites (such as Facebook or Google Reviews) are likewise governed by those
      companies' policies.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep your information</h2>
    <p>
      We keep contact messages only as long as we need them to organize your event or answer
      your question, then delete them in the normal course of business.
    </p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      Want to know what information we have about you, or want it deleted? Just call us at
      <a href="tel:+17028787653">702-878-POLE (7653)</a> or send a note through the
      <a href="/contact">contact page</a> and we will take care of it.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we change how we handle your information, we will update this page and the date at the
      top.
    </p>
  </section>
</PageLayout>

